// The promo sheet comes up while the next tap is on its way: whether the tap lands before the sheet or
// the sheet intercepts it (then Back closes it and the tap is sent again), the target ends up tapped.
// A sheet that comes up after the tap is closed the same way by the Back tap, still in the region.
// Android in-app SDK only: the SDK reports a tap another window would take.
launchApp(androidAppId = "ge.devtool.samples")
waitFor("Sample Screens", timeout = 15s)
scrollTo("Modals", maxScrolls = 6, duration = 150ms)
tap("Modals")
tap(testTag("sample.modals.promo.soon"))
dismissInterruptingDialogs(true)
tap(testTag("sample.modals.promo.target"))
assertVisible(contains("Target tapped"))
tap("Back")
dismissInterruptingDialogs(false)
waitFor("Sample Screens")
